- [AI Agent with Python SDK](https://getalchemystai.com/docs/tutorials/python-agent.md): Learn how to build a context-aware AI CLI agent using the Alchemyst Python SDK
- [AI Agent with TypeScript SDK](https://getalchemystai.com/docs/tutorials/typescript-agent.md): Learn how to build an end-to-end CLI AI Agent using the Alchemyst TypeScript SDK

